<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-WEST INDIES WIN 4TH ONE-DAYER BY 10 WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES WIN 4TH ONE-DAYER BY 10 WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat India by 10 wickets in the fourth and final one-day international at Kensington Oval on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 199-7 (50 overs), West Indies 200-0 (44.4).</p>
<p>West Indies win series 3-1.</p>
</text>
